  ('3833', 2025, 'fringe', 'Benefit: Bargaining paid for the benefit of the employee', 'conditional', '3883', '3833/3883', 'Only applicable from the 2020 year of assessment | applicable from the 2020 year of assessment | applicable from 2020 year of assessment', 'Only applicable from the 2020 year of assessment', 'SARS PAYE BRS - PAYE Employer Reconciliation V23.0.0 (effective 1 March 2024; PDF sha256 220bf3ac4e13f5ffb0e8f4d090071db1babdcfec2425c5c5526d74d509e350ca); row text carried from the SARS PAYE-AE-06-G06 (Guide for Codes Applicable to Employees Tax Certificates 2026) 2026 list (no change in meaning for this code)', 'https://www.sars.gov.za/wp-content/uploads/Docs/PAYE/BRS/SARS_PAYE_BRS-PAYE-Employer-Reconciliation_V23-0-0.pdf', '• Value of taxable benefit i.e. employer’s Bargaining Council contributions . Council • This provision is not applicable to contributions made to pension or Employer provident fund. Contributions (PAYE) Note: ▫ Use code 3883 ONLY for Foreign Service income. ▫ Codes are applicable from 2020 year of assessment. ▫ The amount must be equal to the amount of code 4584.', 'v23.0.0'),
